#### 2. AstGen 구현 (astgen.zig)

```zig
fn genTryExpr(self: *AstGen, node: *const Node) !Zir.Ref {
    const try_expr = node.data.try_expr;

    const expr = try self.genNode(try_expr.expr);

    return try self.zir.addInstruction(.{
        .try_expr = .{
            .expr = expr,
            .catch_ref = null,  // Step 1에서는 기본
        },
    });
}
```

